* If the column does not exist, `java -jar app.jar column data.csv missing_col` prints "no such column: missing_col" to stderr and exits with code 4.
* If the file does not exist, `java -jar app.jar column missing.csv name` prints "no such file: missing.csv" to stderr and exits with code 1.

